# Personal/private data guard — applies to every skill in this repo.
# Journal entries, generated reports, and per-user config must never be pushed,
# even though this repo is public. Anchored to each skill's ROOT so source dirs
# like scripts/lib/reports are not affected.
/skills/*/data/
/skills/*/reports/
/skills/*/config.json
/config.json

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
